{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "xignal-s1000d",
  "name": "Xignal S1000D (data-module-per-page)",
  "description": "Reproduces the Xignal / Docuneering S1000D PDF page: mirrored 25/15 mm margins, 19 mm header and footer bands with 1.13 pt rules, logo + publication code + classification in the head, applicability + DMC + end-of-data-module + date/page in the foot, three rotated margin marks (draft line, printed stamp, company), Arial. Geometry measured from the reference PDF RDR-1671Y-00039-00; all values are editable.",
